    "generalSituationZh": "受高空反氣旋支配，未來數日華南普遍晴朗。而現時影響沿岸地區的東北季候風會在下週初逐漸緩和，該區日間炎熱，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。預料一股偏東氣流會在下週中後期影響廣東沿岸。",
    "generalSituationEn": "Under the dominance of an anticyclone aloft, the weather will be generally fine over southern China in the next few days. The northeast monsoon now affecting the coastal areas will moderate gradually early next week. It will be hot during the day over the region. The temperature difference between day and night will be rather large over inland areas. An easterly airstream is expected to affect the coast of Guangdong in the middle and latter parts of next week.",
